  "_comment": "Forked from ts_ben (upright human, height 0.95, 32 poses, 69 visemes). UPRIGHT on purpose: the pigs in this tale build houses and carry bundles, which needs hands and a standing silhouette — a side-view quadruped cannot do it. Species reads from three cues on a human frame: a centred snout disc with two nostrils BELOW the eye line (eyes are at y 0.705 on this rig, so the snout sits at 0.50-0.675 and is never covered by them), triangular ears on the skull, and a curly tail. Part ids are ts_ben's: ToonRigRepair grafts the starter human's body/head/mouth/eyes onto any rig missing those exact ids."
